### ========================================
### FEATURE 1: USER MANAGEMENT
### ========================================

### 1.1 Create a new library member
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luke Skywalker",
  "email": "luke@jedi.com"
}

### 1.2 Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Update user name (DUPA CE CREEZI USERUL MAI SUS, COPIAZA ID-UL LUI AICI)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/69b81f6145007442ddc90634/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Master Luke Skywalker"
}

### ========================================
### FEATURE 2 & 3: BOOK & BORROWING MANAGEMENT
### ========================================

### 2.1 Add a new book to the library
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Art of Lightsaber Combat",
  "borrowerEmail": "luke@jedi.com"
}

### 2.2 Get books borrowed by user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?borrowerEmail=luke@jedi.com
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Get book by ID (DUPA CE CREEZI CARTEA MAI SUS, COPIAZA ID-UL EI AICI)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/69b81fae45007442ddc90635
Accept: application/json

### 3.1 Mark book as currently borrowed (true/false)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/books/69b81fae45007442ddc90635/borrowed
Content-Type: application/json

true

### 3.2 Create a second user (Leia)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leia Organa",
  "email": "leia@rebellion.com"
}

### 3.3 Re-assign the book to another user (Transfer borrow)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/books/69b81fae45007442ddc90635/borrower
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newBorrowerEmail": "leia@rebellion.com"
}

### ========================================
### CLEANUP (DELETE ENDPOINTS)
### ========================================

### Delete the book
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/69b81fae45007442ddc90635

### Delete the user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/69b81fea45007442ddc90636